---
import '../styles/policy-visual.css';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy and your inquiry data" description="How KEEYAK saves inquiries, protects contact details and uses random visitor identifiers for website measurement.">
 <Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Privacy'}]}/>
 <PageHero title="Privacy and your inquiry data" subtitle="How we handle inquiries, browser drafts and direct contact"/>
 <section class="policy-visual shell">
  <div class="policy-group" data-core-module data-module="entered-information"><h2>When your inquiry is saved</h2><p>Choosing Review inquiry prepares a draft. Choosing Send inquiry submits your models, quantities, destination, contact details and purchasing notes to KEEYAK. The website displays an inquiry reference after saving your submission. This does not create an order or reserve a vehicle.</p><p>Authorized staff use your inquiry to review the request, contact you and keep follow-up notes. Only logged-in administrators can view your contact details or export inquiry data. Do not include identity documents, card details or payment passwords in the notes.</p></div>
  <div class="policy-group" data-core-module data-module="browser-draft"><h2>Your browser draft</h2><p>The form saves a draft in this tab so you can return after refreshing. Use Clear this tab’s saved draft to remove that local copy and its saved submission confirmation. This does not delete an inquiry you already submitted.</p><p>When you open the form from a model page or a short inquiry form, the link can prefill vehicle details and your destination. Your contact details and purchasing notes remain in the form and are not added to navigation links.</p></div>
  <div class="policy-group" data-core-module data-module="sending-channels"><h2>Email and WhatsApp inquiries</h2><p>You can copy the brief or open it in email or WhatsApp. These links pass the full brief, including any contact details and notes you entered, to the selected app to prepare your message. Review it there before sending. Opening an app does not submit the website form. Those providers handle messages under their own information practices.</p></div>
  <div class="policy-group" id="measurement" data-core-module data-module="anonymous-measurement">
   <h2>Website usage measurement</h2>
   <p>Website usage measurement is enabled by default. We use random visitor and session cookies to recognize repeat visits and record views and interactions with vehicles, photos, specifications, downloads, forms and contact links. Activity from the same browser may be linked to an inquiry you submit. We do not record keystrokes or unfinished form entries for usage measurement.</p>
   <p>You can manage measurement below. Basic counts record the page, language, time, button area and country when available. They use no analytics cookies, browser identifier or form contents and cannot be linked to your inquiry. Turning measurement off stops these counts too. We respect your browser’s Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control signal.</p>
   <p>Submitted inquiries remain available for business follow-up even if measurement is off. Contact KEEYAK to ask about stored information or request access, correction or deletion.</p>
   <div data-measurement-preferences hidden>
    <p data-measurement-status role="status"></p>
    <div class="content-actions">
     <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-allow-measurement>Enable usage measurement</button>
     <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-basic-measurement>Use basic counts only</button>
     <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-decline-measurement>Turn off measurement</button>
    </div>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="policy-group" data-core-module data-module="external-links-and-contact"><h2>External services and privacy questions</h2><p>Source records and direct-contact links may take you to other websites or services. Their information practices apply there.</p><p>For questions about information sent to KEEYAK, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@keeyak.com">contact@keeyak.com</a>.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/quote/">Return to your vehicle brief</a></div>
 </section>
</Base>
